    "title": "Toompas moves back into lead in Port of Olympia Commission, District No. 2 race - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Wyatt Haupt Jr. ,\n4 hours ago Challenger Jerry Toompas came from behind to move ahead of incumbent Bob Iyall for the Port of Commission, District No. 2 seat in the Nov. 4 General Election. Toompas overcame a 32 vote deficit from earlier in the week to lead with 38,929 votes or 49.86 percent, compared with 38,799 or 49.69 percent for Iyall, according to unofficial election results from the Thurston County Auditor’s Office Elections Division. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
